---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms of use — AISEOOnline"
  description="Read the current draft usage conditions for AISEOOnline SEO tools, including safe use, service limitations and open-source licensing."
>
  <section class="page-banner">
    <div class="site-container max-w-4xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms of use</p><h1 class="section-title mt-4">
        Use the tools responsibly.
      </h1>
      <p class="page-intro">
        These usage terms are a draft pending operator and legal review. The legal entity,
        jurisdiction and dispute contact method are not finalized.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-space">
    <div class="site-container max-w-3xl space-y-7 leading-8 text-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Scope of the service</h2>
      <p>
        AISEOOnline provides bounded technical checks of publicly available web resources. Available
        checks may have request limits, timeouts, unavailable dependencies or temporary outages.
        Planned private audits, website verification and paid model capabilities are not
        automatically part of the public service.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Authorized and fair use</h2>
      <p>
        Use the checkers only for public URLs you are permitted to inspect. Do not attempt to evade
        quotas, probe private networks or metadata services, submit credentials or private records,
        disrupt the service, or use these tools for unauthorized access. Checks are subject to
        network and resource protections.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Accuracy and limitations</h2>
      <p>
        Reports reflect a bounded snapshot of what the server could retrieve. Search engines can
        render, crawl and interpret the same resource differently. AI suggestions may be incorrect
        and always require human review. No ranking, indexing, rich result, revenue or traffic
        outcome is guaranteed.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Open-source code</h2>
      <p>
        The repository is distributed under the <a
          class="inline-link"
          href="https://github.com/bharathumashankar/aiseoonline/blob/main/LICENSE"
          >Apache License 2.0</a
        >. That software license is separate from any future hosted-service rules.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Updates and operator review</h2>
      <p>
        Tool scope and quotas may change with technical and security needs. Before a hosted
        production launch, the operator must review enforceable terms, legal identity, governing
        law, applicable rights and a confidential contact channel. See <a
          class="inline-link"
          href="/privacy/">privacy information</a
        > and <a class="inline-link" href="/contact/">project feedback</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
